# Variant prod: the hotschmoe-dd production candidate on b70/dd-serve (owner: worker INT).
# Parity target: strata/flash-next/dd/hotschmoe-dd-0216.json (4 slots, 200000 context, int8 KV with RAM backing,
# MTP, vision, reasoning on, effort medium, 16384 thinking budget).
# FROZEN 2026-11-22 11:20 UTC: b70/dd-rel ebdc73dd = 983cc068 + KRN 03719727 (B1' recorded windows over paged KV,
# refusal -> immediate fallback) with XPU_FN_RECORD=1 XPU_FN_GATE=1. Stacked arm workers/INT/stack8.
# ROLLBACK A (983cc068, cache 6, RECORD off: delete the XPU_FN_RECORD line): TF_COMMIT=983cc0686bcd835e62481ec07565f2c580409688
#   TF_BIN=/mnt/vm_8tb/b70/build/tensorfold-dd/983cc068/zig-out/xpu/bin/tensorfold-native
